# AI-Powered Smart Admission System

An intelligent admission automation platform that streamlines document verification, eligibility assessment, applicant shortlisting, financial aid evaluation, and feedback generation using a multi-agent AI architecture.

## Overview

The system is designed to reduce manual effort, accelerate application processing, and improve transparency throughout the admission lifecycle. By combining document intelligence, AI agents, and semantic knowledge retrieval, the platform enables faster and more consistent admission decisions.

## Key Features

* Automated document verification
* AI-powered eligibility assessment
* Intelligent applicant shortlisting
* Financial aid and loan evaluation
* Personalized application feedback
* Automated PDF report generation
* Real-time application status tracking

## Architecture

### Document Intelligence Layer

* Hybrid OCR for document extraction
* Support for scanned and digital documents
* Adaptive preprocessing for low-quality files

### Multi-Agent Decision Engine

* Validation Agent
* Eligibility Agent
* Shortlisting Agent
* Loan Processing Agent
* Feedback Agent
* PDF Generator Agent

### Knowledge Base

* Vector database for semantic retrieval
* Historical applicant profiling
* Continuous learning and improvement

### Reporting & Feedback System

* Automated report generation
* Transparent decision explanations
* Real-time progress tracking

## Tech Stack

* OCR (Tesseract)
* Large Language Models (LLMs)
* Vector Databases (FAISS)
* FastAPI
* Python
* PDF Generation Tools

## Objective

To transform traditional admission workflows into an intelligent, transparent, and scalable process that reduces processing time, improves decision consistency, and enhances the applicant experience.

## Future Work

* Fraud detection for submitted documents
* Multi-language document support
* Predictive admission analytics
* Explainable AI recommendations
* Integration with university ERP systems

